  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fd333e05fc6655246b501ccbd8d989b4, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryData_1preday
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Day: 1
  storyText:
  - contentText: Aku Aldo
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Seorang ayah yang hidup sederhana di kota yang padat
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Aku tinggal bersama istriku, Nasya. dan 2 anakku.
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Menjadi seorang ayah ternyata tidak mudah
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Apalagi dengan kondisi alam bumi yang semakin tak nyaman.
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: 44 Celcius
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Udara yang kian kering. suhu bumi menaiki peningkatan dalam 6 bulan terakhir
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Situasi disini tidak membaik.
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Satu rekaman para ilmuwan pecah ke publik
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: '[Effect]It''s Getting Worse.'
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: ......
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Surat kabar menyebar cepat
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Memercik kepanikan dan keresahan masa
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: '"Secure Your Seat. Escape to Seybay Outpost."'
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Surat kabar trending hari itu.
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Aku harus membawa istri dan anak-anakku pergi.
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Meski ini bukan hari pertama menjadi seorang penjaga loket.
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Rasanya.. Besok shift pertama dengan suasana yang baru.
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Nasya, Virly, Kraisa..
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: Bertahanlah..
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
  - contentText: ....
    audioSource: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b90f18b2a3c26014587a8193551341a5, type: 3}
    textSpeed: 0.03
    
